# The built interface IS committed: that is what keeps deployment to
# git pull + bench migrate + bench restart, with no Node on the server.
# Vite's manifest is not needed -- the page references stable filenames.
# .vite/manifest.json IS committed: the page reads it to find the hashed
# bundle. Without it the template has no way to know the filename.
